# Legacy fallback only: ignored whenever the corresponding JSON configuration file exists.
# Copy to .env.yandu.local at the Sachi root (already ignored by Git).
# Restrict the actual file to mode 0600. Never put a real key in this template.
# Yandu project: same project selected in blog.config.json.yandu.projectId.
# Permissions: read, upload, metadata. Use a DIFFERENT read-only key on the server.
YANDU_UPLOAD_KEY=
